{
  "name": "Warp Keybindings Subsystem",
  "description": "Focused, accurate map of how keyboard shortcuts work in Warp: the keymap engine (Keymap/Matcher/Context/overlap oracle), the dispatch + responder chain, the keybindings.yaml config + load/override path, the settings-UI editor + cheatsheet, and the modal (vim) editing pipeline (pure FSA -> VimEvent -> VimHandler) with its reusable buffer algorithms. Spans the warpui_core, vim, editor crates and the warp app integration layer.",
